{
  "about": "Canonical Purple Desktop host gates, run by purple/run_host_gates.py. A patch that adds, renames or removes a gate, a variant, a compiled purple/test_*.cpp fixture or a program under Telegram/SourceFiles/purple/tests updates this list in the same commit. K3 removes dormant search/mark/setup/carry suites and retains active typed record, ordinary upload, account-fence and Magic first-use coverage. Placeholders: {build} is --build-dir, {out} is this configuration's output directory, {out:NAME} is the output directory of configuration NAME, which then runs first. \"variants\" maps the flags of a driver with several configurations to the fixture each selects; \"\" is its default. Media integration retains the K3 roster and adds every active media and recording configuration from the frozen reviewed feature tip.",
